{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233580","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233580","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423358001:1":{"text":"방금 지나온 다리는 거대한 버섯으로 만든 건가요...?","source_cn":"我们刚刚走过的桥，是巨大的蕈类搭建而成的吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9872C1DFBF651EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423358002:1":{"text":"그건 거대 버섯 다리예요. 그런데 저런 버섯은 맛이 없어요!","source_cn":"那是大蘑菇桥……这种大蘑菇不好吃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B36A38FDA674031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423358003:1":{"text":"하하하, 제이미가 점점 더 설명을 재미있게 하게 되었네.","source_cn":"哈哈哈，詹米的讲解也越来越有模有样了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCCC111065BB296B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423358004:1":{"text":"여기 있는 식물들은 바투소 산맥과 많이 다르네요. 조금 더 알고 싶은데, 혹시 소개해 줄 수 있나요?","source_cn":"这里的植被和瓦度索山脉有很大不同，我想多了解一些，你们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4F116466CC15FE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423358005:1":{"text":"물론이죠! 여기 하얀 줄기와 보라색 갓을 가진 버섯은 솜털 버섯이라고 하는데, 셀로클랜드에서 흔하게 보이는 식재료 중 하나예요.","source_cn":"当然没问题！这种白杆紫色伞盖的菌菇名叫茸茸伞菇，在萨洛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C0204B2AD74CD32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423358006:1":{"text":"여기 보라색 꽃잎에 노란 꽃술이 달린 꽃은...","source_cn":"这种紫色花瓣黄色花蕊的花……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D6957C9F700E19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423358007:1":{"text":"그건 캔들위크예요! 엄마가 그랬는데, 뿌리줄기에만 독이 없고 먹으면 매콤하댔어요!","source_cn":"这是蚀芯花！妈妈告诉我它全身上下只有根茎没毒，吃起来辣辣的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B3267A9FF05B6E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423358008:1":{"text":"제이미, 정말 대단하다!","source_cn":"詹米好厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ECEE5646BEEF6EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423358009:1":{"text":"얘들아, 더 알아보고 싶니? 가까이 가서 관찰해보렴!","source_cn":"孩子们，想要更了解它们吗？去近距离观察一下它们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE048AD1BC253DC6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423358010:1":{"text":"네~!","source_cn":"好哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x284925E5A5B5AAF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423358011:1":{"text":"나도 갈래!","source_cn":"我也去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x060C5228B666770C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423358012:1":{"text":"...기다려!","source_cn":"……等等我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4A0FA0E848E6393","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1423358013:1":{"text":"프라벨 선생님은 정말 대단하세요. 아이들의 시선을 사로잡을 뿐만 아니라 공부를 정말 즐겁게 만들어 주시네요...","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔老师，你真的很厉害。你的教学不仅牢牢吸引了她们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9D533C83E0A11A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1423358014:1":{"text":"어떻게 하면 그렇게 좋은 선생님이 될 수 있나요?","source_cn":"你是怎样成为一名好老师的呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABAA83D3DAECF942","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1423358015:1":{"text":"어머나, 그런 칭찬은... 몸 둘 바를 모르겠네요.","source_cn":"这样的称赞……我受宠若惊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7323DE0A6D27EE71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1423358016:1":{"text":"하지만 저도 항상 어떻게 하면 배우는 즐거움을 느끼게 할 수 있을지, 어떻게 하면 더 편하게 공부할 수 있을지 생각해요.","source_cn":"不过我确实经常思考，怎样的教学会让她们感受到学习的乐趣...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12C41C49C7251092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1423358017:1":{"text":"그래서 다양한 미니 게임을 생각해 냈답니다.","source_cn":"为此，我还设计了不少小游戏呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E166CEB311C639B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1423358018:1":{"text":"미니 게임이요? 저도 가르쳐주실 수 있나요?","source_cn":"小游戏！可以教教我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x913F17D898BE8F0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1423358019:1":{"text":"그럼 솜털 버섯과 캔들위크를 학습 목표로 삼고, 제가 자주 쓰는 카드 맞추기 게임을 예시로 들어볼게요.","source_cn":"就以茸茸伞菇和蚀芯花作为教学目标，以我常用的卡片识图游...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10DEFAC4FA413F88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1423358020:1":{"text":"일단 솜털 버섯과 캔들위크 그림 카드를 여러 장 그려요. 그리고 학생들이 이걸 보면서 더 확실하게 기억할 수 있도록 하는 거예요...","source_cn":"我会绘制很多带有茸茸伞菇与蚀芯花图案的卡片，让学生识别...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x312FE6993FEE248C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:25:1423358021:1":{"text":"프라벨은 도구를 꺼내더니 금세 솜털 버섯과 캔들위크가 그려진 카드 몇 장을 그려냈다.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBE392AD636DDF66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1423358022:1":{"text":"한 번 해 보면 금세 규칙을 알게 될 거예요. 오로나, 해보겠어요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 해보세요.","source_cn":"只要玩过一遍就会知道规则，欧罗娜要来试一试吗？<sty...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25BD7DF0CC8A458D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"한 번 해 보면 금세 규칙을 알게 될 거예요. 오로나, 해보겠어요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 해보세요.","female":"한 번 해 보면 금세 규칙을 알게 될 거예요. 오로나, 해보겠어요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 해보세요.","variant_male_record_index":"170083","variant_female_record_index":"170084","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:芙拉贝尔":{"text":"프라벨","source":"芙拉贝尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:詹米":{"text":"제이미","source":"詹米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:勇敢的花灵":{"text":"용감한 플로라","source":"勇敢的花灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:冷静的花灵":{"text":"냉정한 플로라","source":"冷静的花灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:胆怯的花灵":{"text":"겁먹은 플로라","source":"胆怯的花灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":23,"localized_text_count":22,"speaker_count":7}}